        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9164b92663d74f6bbbe4ca49d3da60b6",
      "statement": "The same 2026-09-08 ARB session that published ADR-PAY-026 separately declined to approve interim direct channel exposure of the raw GPI_TRACKER_SNAPSHOT feed, reinforcing that channels are expected to consume governed serving endpoints rather than raw payments/treasury data.",
